ame": "011.RS_D+_Screenshot_03.png", "id": "1062786108591961", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830890_1062786111925294_6820825958812217735_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Zqf7sw2Ic5sQ7kNvwE4-Omu&_nc_oc=AdkJpEtwImbwZZp_B6gCRQjz-rKtxZ0XF8PXJRJnfn6wXRuLZIGIyQws5GFukOy8p_M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvXK3uXf_pfgIDGlD0NjRF-N3T-gLnwTbO_lrUhRulF5g&oe=699DA72D"}, {"file_name": "012.RS_D+_Screenshot_04.png", "id": "1888807391681363", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499308589_1888807395014696_660138509703032651_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lMqwGrh9eRUQ7kNvwEHoHyu&_nc_oc=AdlhSjruuUpA7GA5PhxslwdmfGFua3yMt5KD_Nf3xjGl7m9ZVembeJBBs6NTwap_Dzo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvmqnZSjX6ylWhCKtKvD4ew_ZWCC43rdHVDi3-Ql1v5OA&oe=699DB5BA"}, {"file_name": "009.RS_D+_Screenshot_01.png", "id": "4068036953513638", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499292867_4068036956846971_624713770870370506_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eWCjlJriZsEQ7kNvwGqNH7X&_nc_oc=AdkqNDJte6ys_uUlzfRh_0N0obdVUhOFUFJqgLZQgg2TNAsO4Cx2-HAF_Ihh5XNIFLo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftNvCehwAm1hcfKPfsTciuiMnIINQOV81tnAhSIIh5M-w&oe=699D9CA1"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "RS-Dental+", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Important: More content is available with institutional registration.\n\nRSD+ is a VR-based simulator for dental radiographic diagnosis and practice, providing students with a realistic environment to train in radiography procedures without exposure to radiation.\n\nThrough various scenario-based simulations, learners can train in patient interaction, chart review, clinical assessment, X-ray equipment handling, film positioning, and post-exam image review.\n\n With VRAD's patented medical image processing algorithm, X-ray images are dynamically generated based